WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.728
EXPECT TO HEAR FROM FLORIDA

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:04.458
GOVERNOR RON DESANTIS TOMORROW.

00:00:04.492 --> 00:00:05.744
&gt;&gt; Dana: COVID LOCKDOWNS ARE

00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:06.214
ENDING.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:09.163
ADOPTIONS ARE ON HOLD FOR

00:00:09.165 --> 00:00:10.739
THOUSANDS OF AMERICAN FAMILIES.

00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:13.119
THE CLEVELAND ARE TRYING TO

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.744
ADOPT A LITTLE GIRL NAMED RUBY

00:00:14.778 --> 00:00:15.385
FROM CHINA.

00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:17.618
SUPPOSED TO PICK HER UP A YEAR

00:00:17.653 --> 00:00:20.568
AND A HALF TO GO AFTER FIGHTING

00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:22.808
TWO YEARS TO GET THEIR

00:00:22.843 --> 00:00:24.475
APPLICATION APPROVED.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.159
TRAVEL RESTRICTIONS AREN’T

00:00:26.161 --> 00:00:27.553
APPROVED FREEZING THE PROPER

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:28.122
SEZ.

00:00:28.123 --> 00:00:30.482
WE TALKED LAST YEAR WHEN THIS

00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:31.647
ALL FIRST STARTED AND REMIND

00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:34.017
EVERYONE HOW OLD IS RUBY NOW

00:00:34.051 --> 00:00:35.347
AND HAVE YOU HAD ANY CONTACT

00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:36.398
WITH HER?

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:39.101
&gt;&gt; YES, THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR

00:00:39.102 --> 00:00:40.565
HAVING US, DANA.

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:41.815
WE REALLY APPRECIATE THIS

00:00:41.849 --> 00:00:42.497
OPPORTUNITY.

00:00:42.532 --> 00:00:45.732
RUBY WILL BE FIVE IN AUGUST.

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.815
WHEN WE STARTED THIS PROCESS,

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.392
RUBY WAS 2 1/2.

00:00:49.394 --> 00:00:52.767
SO IT’S BEEN MANY YEARS OF

00:00:52.768 --> 00:00:54.947
WAITING AND WE ARE JUST PRAYING

00:00:54.949 --> 00:00:57.526
AND BELIEVING THAT SOME MIRACLE

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.249
WE GET HER BEFORE SHE TURNS

00:00:59.250 --> 00:00:59.702
FIVE.

00:00:59.737 --> 00:01:02.354
&gt;&gt; Dana: WHAT HAVE YOU BEEN

00:01:02.356 --> 00:01:03.961
TOLD IS THE REASON FOR THE

00:01:03.995 --> 00:01:04.404
HOLD-UP?

00:01:04.438 --> 00:01:06.413
&gt;&gt; CHINA IS WAITING ON THE

00:01:06.414 --> 00:01:08.429
PANDEMIC SAYING WE WANT TO KEEP

00:01:08.431 --> 00:01:10.858
OUR CHILDREN SAFE AND CLOSELY

00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:12.669
WATCHING AMERICA AND CASES AND

00:01:12.703 --> 00:01:14.201
CLOSELY WATCHING THE VACCINE

00:01:14.236 --> 00:01:16.318
AND SO THEY ARE WAITING ON THE

00:01:16.319 --> 00:01:17.484
PANDEMIC TO BE OVER FROM WHAT

00:01:17.485 --> 00:01:18.415
WE’RE TOLD.

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:20.391
&gt;&gt; Dana: HAVE YOU HEARD FROM

00:01:20.393 --> 00:01:22.658
THE STATE DEPARTMENT ON WHETHER

00:01:22.659 --> 00:01:25.191
THEY ARE TRYING TO HELP GET

00:01:25.226 --> 00:01:26.099
THIS RESOLVED?

00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:26.957
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:01:26.959 --> 00:01:28.736
SO THANKFULLY OUR SECRETARY OF

00:01:28.771 --> 00:01:31.352
STATE HAS BEEN SO WONDERFUL AND

00:01:31.386 --> 00:01:33.463
THEY HAVE BEEN IN CLOSE CONTACT

00:01:33.464 --> 00:01:35.483
WITH THE CHINESE EMBASSY AND

00:01:35.484 --> 00:01:37.618
JUST REALLY TRYING TO GET US ON

00:01:37.619 --> 00:01:39.150
A PLANE AND THE MANY FAMILIES

00:01:39.185 --> 00:01:40.692
THAT ARE WAITING TO GO GET

00:01:40.694 --> 00:01:41.905
THEIR CHILDREN THAT HAVE BEEN

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.072
PROMISED TO THEM.

00:01:43.073 --> 00:01:45.451
SO THEY ARE TRYING AND DOING

00:01:45.452 --> 00:01:47.156
EVERYTHING THAT THEY CAN BUT AS

00:01:47.157 --> 00:01:49.973
YOU KNOW, IT IS JUST CONTINUING

00:01:49.974 --> 00:01:51.236
TO HIT A WALL.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.315
&gt;&gt; Dana: NOAH, ARE YOU

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:54.049
CONCERNED ABOUT THE GROWING

00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:55.238
TENSIONS BETWEEN THE UNITED

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.914
STATES AND CHINA POSSIBLY

00:01:56.915 --> 00:01:58.108
DELAYING THIS EVEN FURTHER?

00:01:58.109 --> 00:02:00.328
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, DANA, HERE IS WHAT

00:02:00.363 --> 00:02:01.750
I BELIEVE AND HERE IS WHAT I

00:02:01.751 --> 00:02:03.212
KNOW MY WIFE BELIEVES.

00:02:03.246 --> 00:02:05.418
WE TRUST GOD AND HE ALONE GETS

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.045
THE LAST WORD AND SO WE CAN BE

00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:10.247
FEARFUL OF WHAT IS GOING ON

00:02:10.249 --> 00:02:11.533
WITH CHINA AND THE U.S.

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:13.083
MANY TIMES WE SAY GOD, CAN YOU

00:02:13.084 --> 00:02:15.161
MAKE A WAY BUT HERE IS THE ONE

00:02:15.162 --> 00:02:16.691
THING WE KNOW IS THAT GOD IS

00:02:16.693 --> 00:02:19.043
GOOD AND WE HAVE PEACE.

00:02:19.078 --> 00:02:20.832
IT IS WELL WITH OUR SOULS.

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:22.618
THERE IS AN OLD SONG CALLED IT

00:02:22.653 --> 00:02:24.046
IS WELL WITH MY SOUL AND WE

00:02:24.047 --> 00:02:24.686
HAVE PEACE.

00:02:24.687 --> 00:02:26.605
NO MATTER WHAT’S GOING ON IN

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.502
THE WORLD WITH CHINA AND THE

00:02:28.536 --> 00:02:30.287
U.S., GOD, JESUS ALONE GETS THE

00:02:30.321 --> 00:02:30.990
LAST WORD.

00:02:31.024 --> 00:02:33.309
&gt;&gt; Dana: IVY, TELL US WHAT KIND

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:34.936
OF INFORMATION DO YOU GET ABOUT

00:02:34.971 --> 00:02:36.495
HOW RUBY IS DOING?

00:02:36.529 --> 00:02:39.795
&gt;&gt; WE DON’T GET A LOT OF

00:02:39.796 --> 00:02:42.267
UPDATES BUT WE GET THEM ABOUT

00:02:42.269 --> 00:02:44.200
EVERY SIX MONTHS OR SO.

00:02:44.201 --> 00:02:46.924
SINCE THE PANDEMIC HAS HAPPENED

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.838
WE HAVE GOTTEN PROBABLY TWO

00:02:48.839 --> 00:02:50.741
VIDEOS, MAYBE THREE PICTURES.

00:02:50.743 --> 00:02:52.812
AND FROM WHAT WE GATHER SHE IS

00:02:52.813 --> 00:02:53.864
DOING GREAT.

00:02:53.898 --> 00:02:56.040
SHE IS THRIVING AND SHE DOES

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.098
NOT HAVE ANY ISSUES THUS FAR

00:02:59.099 --> 00:03:01.166
AND SO WE ARE SO GRATEFUL FOR

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:01.676
THAT.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.382
OBVIOUSLY MY MAMA HEART WISHES

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.806
I COULD HOLD MY BABY, WISHES

00:03:05.807 --> 00:03:07.658
THAT I DO NOT HAVE TO BE APART

00:03:07.659 --> 00:03:08.985
FROM HER.

00:03:09.019 --> 00:03:12.058
MY MAMA HEART HATES THE FACT

00:03:12.093 --> 00:03:14.517
THAT HER ROOM HAS SAT EMPTY.

00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:16.295
LOTS OF CLOTHES, LOTS OF LITTLE

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.977
BOWS THAT SHE HAS YET TO BE

00:03:19.011 --> 00:03:20.778
ABLE TO WEAR AND ALL THOSE ARE

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.932
TRIVIAL THINGS.

00:03:21.933 --> 00:03:24.799
IT IS VERY HARD TO WALK BY HER

00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:26.828
ROOM AND SEE THAT NOT KNOWING

00:03:26.863 --> 00:03:28.040
THAT WHEN SHE IS GOING TO

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:28.794
OCCUPY IT.

00:03:28.828 --> 00:03:30.973
NOT KNOWING WHEN I WILL BE ABLE

00:03:30.975 --> 00:03:32.936
TO GET THIS CHILD THAT WE HAVE

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.194
FOUGHT SO HARD TO GET.

00:03:34.196 --> 00:03:35.536
THE TRUTH IS, WE HAVE JUMPED

00:03:35.571 --> 00:03:37.215
THROUGH ALL THE HOOPS.

00:03:37.216 --> 00:03:39.203
WE HAVE PAID ALL THE FEES, WE

00:03:39.204 --> 00:03:41.429
HAVE DONE ALL THE THINGS THAT

00:03:41.431 --> 00:03:42.904
HAVE BEEN REQUIRED OF US.

00:03:42.938 --> 00:03:44.951
SO WE ARE JUST SITTING AT THE

00:03:44.984 --> 00:03:46.167
EDGE OF OUR SEATS WAITING AND

00:03:46.168 --> 00:03:47.814
PRAYING AND BELIEVING THAT

00:03:47.848 --> 00:03:49.626
TODAY COULD BE THE DAY,

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.017
TOMORROW COULD BE THE DAY.

00:03:51.018 --> 00:03:53.052
ANY DAY SOON COULD BE THE DAY.

00:03:53.053 --> 00:03:55.506
&gt;&gt; Dana: I KNOW YOU HAVE VERY

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.917
BIG HEARTS AND I HOPE THAT

00:03:56.952 --> 00:03:58.300
SOMEBODY IN CHINA WILL LISTEN

00:03:58.301 --> 00:03:59.074
AND HAVE ONE AS WELL.

